        "markdown": "# 📺 Source and Attribution Boundary\n\n**Duration represented:** approximately 1:23:00.\n\nLionel opens by describing the political and social-media world as a chaotic battle involving Candace Owens, Tucker Carlson, the Charlie Kirk investigation, Laura Loomer, Trump, Israel, Iran, and other emerging conflicts. \n\nThe transcript is a live monologue with frequent audience comments woven directly into the discussion. Claims about elections, criminal cases, foreign policy, political actors, motives, blackmail, evidence, and institutions are speaker claims unless separately verified.\n\nThis graph studies how Lionel organizes and performs the material.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786058390624,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
