      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-live-synthesis-study-06"
        },
        "markdown": "# 1 · Alarm Hook and Prepper Sponsor\n## 0:00–5:39\n\nLionel opens with a wrestling-style image of the political world as a battle in which nobody appears to be in charge. He rapidly previews Candace, Tucker, the Kirk investigation, Laura Loomer, Trump, vaccines, Israel, Iran, military depletion, and possible supply disruption. \n\nHe then inserts a My Patriot Supply advertisement whose catastrophe framing closely matches the alarm language of the hook. \n\n**Function:** establish a world-in-crisis frame, preview many threads, and monetize before the long synthesis begins.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786058390624,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
