        "markdown": "# 5 · Map the Emerging Actor Field\n## 36:14–45:02\n\nLionel starts naming a widening set of actors he sees entering the same political space: Tucker Carlson, Candace Owens, Marjorie Taylor Greene, Joe Kent, Thomas Massie, Elizabeth Lane, Buckley Carlson, Max Blumenthal, Aaron Mate, Katie Halper, and others. \n\nHe contrasts these emerging voices with figures he believes have disappointed or lost credibility and returns to the problem of military resources, Israel, Iran, Trump, and Laura Loomer. \n\n**Function:** stop describing isolated personalities and begin drawing an **actor field** with entrants, defectors, loyalists, opponents, and uncertain positions.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786058390624,
