        "markdown": "# 6 · Strategic Empathy and Political Mystery\n## 45:02–53:29\n\nLionel pauses the attack posture to say he understands Netanyahu's strategic objectives without sympathizing with them. He labels this distinction empathy and even says he admires some of the persistence involved. \n\nHe then returns to the unresolved Laura Loomer question and shifts into a lawyerly discussion of whether defense counsel should seek information from Candace Owens and Baron Coleman. \n\n**Function:** model an opponent's goals from inside the opponent's perspective, then test related behavior against Lionel's professional standards.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
