        "markdown": "# 8 · Cross-Ideological Curation\n## 58:04–1:05:30\n\nLionel states the principle directly: `I'm taking the best of everybody`. He compares the new information landscape to a neighborhood filled with many different cuisines and says disagreement on other subjects does not prevent him from valuing a person's work on a particular issue. \n\nHe names figures from the left and right whom he selectively accepts, then returns to Laura Loomer, Trump, Iran, media confrontations, and political change. \n\n**Function:** replace loyalty to personalities or parties with issue-by-issue source selection.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
