        },
        "markdown": "# 10 · Community Synthesis and Sunday Close\n## 1:15:22–1:23:00\n\nLionel returns to the emotional center of the episode: something has changed, the old alignment no longer makes sense, and the audience is part of a group seeking truth despite smaller disagreements. \n\nThe close becomes unusually communal. He promotes his wife's work, thanks the moderator, calls the Sunday stream a family feast in which viewers exchange intellectual morsels, asks for likes and subscriptions, suggests another stream may happen later, and signs off. \n\n**Function:** turn ideological synthesis into community identity and ritual closure.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
