        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-live-synthesis-study-06"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧬 Observed Grammar\n\n**alarm hook -> sponsor -> historical catch-up -> propose phase change -> branch to chat -> return to thread -> identify actors -> evaluate defections and alliances -> branch again -> return -> model information network -> curate across ideology -> explain coalition history -> propose new coalition -> convert audience into community**\n\nThis composition has a persistent thesis but not a linear outline.\n\nThe thread survives by **return operations**.\n\nA useful working label is:\n\n## `Associative Realignment Monologue`\n\nThe sequence controller appears to be a **live thematic thread with a stack of temporary branches**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786058390624,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study06-threadstack",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "New Discovery · Thread Stack",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
