        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-live-synthesis-study-06"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🕸️ New Discovery · Information Network Model\n\nStudy 02 showed Lionel aggregating independent researchers.\n\nStudy 06 goes further and describes **how the research network is organized**.\n\nCandace is described as a funnel receiving large quantities of tips and filtering them. Other commentators and specialists analyze video, legal issues, foreign policy, images, and documents. \n\nThis suggests graph primitives such as:\n\n- Research Contributor\n- Tip or Submission\n- Research Funnel\n- Verification Pass\n- Rejected Lead\n- Promoted Lead\n- Specialist Analysis\n- Publication Node\n\nThis is not merely a list of sources. It is an **information-flow topology**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786058390624,
