        },
        "markdown": "# 🎙️ Editorial Moves Observed\n\nStudy 06 strengthens or adds these candidate moves:\n\n- **Lionel Announces Systemic Change**\n- **Lionel Builds a Catch-Up Narrative**\n- **Lionel Locates a Turning Point**\n- **Lionel Opens a Side Thread**\n- **Lionel Returns to the Main Thread**\n- **Lionel Maps an Actor Field**\n- **Lionel Evaluates Strategic Engagement**\n- **Lionel Models an Opponent's Incentives**\n- **Lionel Maps an Information Network**\n- **Lionel Curates Across Ideology**\n- **Lionel Maps Coalition Realignment**\n- **Lionel Uses Historical Coalition Analogy**\n- **Lionel Converts Audience to Community**\n\nSeveral are probably not permanent classes. `Open Side Thread` and `Return to Main Thread`, for example, may be generic navigation operations.",
        "memo": "",
