      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-live-synthesis-study-06"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🔬 Comparison Across Six Studies\n\n## Study 01 · Thesis Monologue\n**Sequence controller:** central proposition.\n\n## Study 02 · Hosted Forensic Commentary\n**Sequence controller:** serial evidence audit plus host intervention.\n\n## Study 03 · Annotated Media Reaction\n**Sequence controller:** one source timeline.\n\n## Study 04 · Thesis-Led Adversarial Media Audit\n**Sequence controller:** Lionel's critique of an opponent's argument.\n\n## Study 05 · Curated Media Mosaic\n**Sequence controller:** ordered and semi-ordered media queue.\n\n## Study 06 · Associative Realignment Monologue\n**Sequence controller:** persistent thematic thread plus live branch stack.\n\n## Critical distinction from Study 05\nStudy 05 changes topics because **Lionel selects the next media object**.\n\nStudy 06 changes topics because **a thought, chat message, remembered example, named actor, or side question opens a temporary branch**.\n\nThe grammar of return is therefore as important as the grammar of transition.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786058390624,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
