      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-live-synthesis-study-06"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧠 Updated Sequence Controller Model\n\nThe six studies now support an explicit episode-level property:\n\n## `sequenceController`\n\nObserved values:\n\n- `thesis`\n- `evidence-audit`\n- `host-interaction`\n- `source-timeline`\n- `opponent-argument`\n- `media-queue`\n- `live-thematic-thread`\n\nStudy 06 also suggests a second orthogonal property:\n\n## `navigationMode`\n\nPossible values:\n\n- `linear`\n- `serial`\n- `source-bound`\n- `queue-driven`\n- `branch-and-return`\n\nThis separates **what controls the episode** from **how the speaker travels through it**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786058390624,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study06-model",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Updated Lionel Package Model",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 890,
