      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-live-synthesis-study-06"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🏗️ Updated Lionel Package Model\n\n## Shared media primitives\nVideo Source, Timed Segment, Transcript Segment, Embedded Source, Claim, Evidence Item, Hypothesis, Person, Organization, Playback Transition.\n\n## Navigation primitives\nTopic Thread, Thread Branch, Return Point, Branch Trigger, Media Queue, Queue Item, Continuation State.\n\n## Network primitives\nResearch Contributor, Research Funnel, Tip, Verification Pass, Rejected Lead, Promoted Lead, Actor Field, Coalition.\n\n## Stable Lionel moves\nStates Thesis, Adds Analogy, Audits Evidence, Defines Standard, Builds Rapport, Separates Questions, Qualifies Theory, Maps Actors, Adds Historical Context, Directs Audience.\n\n## Media moves\nFrames Media, Comments on Media, Replays Media, Audits Argument, Corrects Formulation, Audits Coherence, Contrasts Personas.\n\n## Composition templates now observed\n- Lionel Thesis Monologue\n- Hosted Forensic Commentary\n- Annotated Media Reaction\n- Thesis-Led Adversarial Media Audit\n- Curated Media Mosaic\n- Associative Realignment Monologue",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786058390624,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
